## Why This Is Asked
Tests real-time, multi-tenant coordination, offline resilience, and careful resource cleanup in a plain JS environment. It explores WebSocket management, REST history hydration, IndexedDB caching, and a lightweight DOM virtualization strategy without framework abstractions.

## Key Concepts
- WebSocket management with per-tenant streams and exponential backoff
- Per-tenant history preload via REST and IndexedDB caching
- TenantRouter handling subscribe/unsubscribe on switch
- Lightweight virtualization to render only visible items
- Service Worker caching for assets and per-tenant payloads with offline fallback

